---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Us | HADARA Hospitality"
  description="Learn about HADARA Hospitality, an Istanbul-based hotel textile and guest essentials supply company and part of BYHADARA Group."
  canonicalPath="/about.html"
  active="about"
>
  <main>
    <section class="about-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow light">ABOUT US</p><h1>HADARA <em>Hospitality.</em></h1></div></section>
    <section class="about-intro wrap">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">WHO WE ARE</p><h2>Hospitality supply<br />from <em>Istanbul.</em></h2></div>
      <div>
        <p>At HADARA Hospitality, we are a Turkish hospitality supply company headquartered in Istanbul and part of the BYHADARA Group, active in the hospitality and tourism investment sector.</p>
        <p>We specialize in supplying hotel linen, towels, robes, slippers, and guest room amenities tailored for 3 to 5-star hotels, helping hotels maintain consistent hospitality standards and guest comfort.</p>
        <p>Our carefully selected product collections are designed to meet the operational needs and hospitality standards of modern hotels and resorts.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="about-focus">
      <div class="wrap about-story">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">OUR PARTNERSHIPS</p><h2>Quality and <em>long-term value.</em></h2></div>
        <div>
          <p>Through trusted manufacturing partnerships across Turkey, we combine competitive sourcing with reliable quality standards, operational durability, and long-term value.</p>
          <p>We take pride in building trusted partnerships with hotels and hospitality businesses across the Gulf region and Europe, supporting long-term cooperation and dependable hospitality solutions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="about-outro wrap">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">HADARA HOSPITALITY</p><h2>Complete hospitality<br /><em>solutions.</em></h2></div>
      <div>
        <p>At HADARA Hospitality, we don’t just supply products — we deliver complete hospitality solutions.</p>
        <a class="button button-gold" href="/get-a-quote.html">Request a quote <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
